  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>歡迎來到銅之監獄，這是一座地下要塞，專門用來囚禁最聰明的</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>逃犯。探索狹窄的走廊、少數牢房與令人壓抑的通風口，以及更多設施。逃脫那座</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>由強化銅、凝灰岩和鐵打造的牢房！</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>遊戲特色</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">蜿蜒曲折、燈光昏暗的<strong>通風管道</strong>，寬度僅夠匍匐通過</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">擁擠的<strong>牢房區塊</strong>，配備閃爍的燈具與機械鎖</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">隱藏的開關、紅石陷阱與紅石謎題</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">生鏽的維修隧道，非常適合<strong>秘密潛逃</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">你會選擇遵守規則、維持秩序，還是冒險一試，挑戰不可能的越獄？</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>玩得開心，願上帝保佑你 :)</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_3cde78ee-771e-4439-aa40-863723139555.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"790\" height=\"518\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\">支持我！</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><a href=\"coff.ee/danielboonemc\" rel=\"nofollow\">coff.ee/danielboonemc</a></span><br></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>也來看看我的其他地圖吧！</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/forest-and-fields-adventure-map\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">森林與田野</a></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/seven-survival-islands\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">七座生存島嶼</a></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/the-mysterious-island\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">神秘島嶼</a></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/pale-sky-block\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">蒼白天空島</a></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/boones-sky-block\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">布恩的天空島</a></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/deserts-and-mountains-adventure-map\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">沙漠與山地探險地圖</a></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>J.M.J.</strong></span></p>",
